{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2022-10-26 07:01:00', 'title': 'THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.40 PER SHARE', 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.40 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK PAYABLE ON DEC. 30, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF NOV. 25, 2022."}{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2022-10-26 07:00:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2022.'}